  "_commit": {
    "id": "4005df43501017b00971ca8ed2c60cf3eb548b9c",
    "author": "Damian <damian.szk@gmail.com>",
    "committer": "Damian <damian.szk@gmail.com>",
    "message": "Run the vignette's GSEA code from its R script; version 2.25.5\n\nThe live values/ranks chunks were eval=FALSE, so the vignette's R script\n(and Bioconductor's STRINGdb.R) had them commented out with \"##\", hard\nto copy or run. They now run inside if (interactive()): plain code that\nruns in RStudio, still skipped when the vignette is built, so builds\nsubmit no jobs to STRING.\n\n- The results chunk uses the job id kept by the first chunk, instead of\n  the \"the job identifier\" placeholder.\n- The status table of the submitted jobs is printed.\n- Long lines are wrapped so that they fit the PDF page.\n",
    "time": 1794329160
  },
